[I] Multi-dimensional data index algorithm

[T] mdds is a header-only C++ library providing data structures with
[T] indexing algorithms, such as flat and segment trees, a rectangle set, a
[T] multi-type vector and a multi-type matrix. It is used by LibreOffice and
[T] liborcus.

[U] https://gitlab.com/mdds/mdds

